This slice replaces that with live /api/guests calls, while preserving
the existing visual design via a thin adapter layer.

Files added:
- packages/core/lib/workspace/adapters.ts (toWorkspaceGuest, toWorkspaceGuests)
- packages/core/lib/workspace/hooks.ts (useGuestSearch, useGuestDirectory, useGuest, useGuestCount)
- packages/core/__tests__/workspace-adapters.test.ts (23 new tests)
